Template: homelab-mailsend/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host for the mail lookup tables:

Template: homelab-mailsend/db_port
Type: string
Default: 5432
Description: PostgreSQL port:

Template: homelab-mailsend/db_name
Type: string
Default: mailserver
Description: PostgreSQL database name:

Template: homelab-mailsend/db_user
Type: string
Default: dovecot_user
Description: PostgreSQL role to connect as:

Template: homelab-mailsend/db_password
Type: password
Description: PostgreSQL role password:

Template: homelab-mailsend/domains
Type: string
Default:
Description: Mail domains this server handles (space-separated):
 e.g. "mailmasker.org giraffenow.org". Never assume a single domain.

Template: homelab-mailsend/dovecot_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: Dovecot host (for SASL delegation and LMTP delivery):

Template: homelab-mailsend/dovecot_sasl_mode
Type: select
Choices: local, inet
Default: local
Description: Dovecot SASL delegation mode:
 "local" uses a unix socket -- only valid if Dovecot is on this SAME
 host. "inet" connects to dovecot_host:12345 over the network -- use
 this for a cross-host homelab-mailread (matching current production
 topology), and make sure that host's expose_sasl_auth_inet debconf
 answer is enabled.

Template: homelab-mailsend/dovecot_lmtp_port
Type: string
Default: 24
Description: Dovecot LMTP port (for mail delivery):

Template: homelab-mailsend/enable_roundcube_listener
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Add the Roundcube-specific SMTPS listener on port 10465?
 Disabling this does NOT affect homelab-api's own mail-send feature,
 which already uses port 465.

Template: homelab-mailsend/behind_proxy
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Is this host fronted by HAProxy (PROXY protocol)?
 Enable only if a homelab-mail-proxy (or equivalent) HAProxy instance
 terminates PROXY protocol in front of this host's SMTP listeners.

Template: homelab-mailsend/dkim_milter_address
Type: string
Default: inet:localhost:8891
Description: DKIM signer milter address:
 Defaults to classic OpenDKIM's address, matching production. Point this
 at a different address (e.g. inet:localhost:10027) if a different DKIM
 signer is in use. Leave blank to skip DKIM milter wiring entirely.

Template: homelab-mailsend/manage_master_cf_listeners
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Add homelab-mailsend's managed submission/smtps listener block to master.cf?
 Pre-seeded by postinst's own scan of master.cf: left false if an
 existing submission/smtps listener was already found (the safe default
 on an already-configured host, avoiding a duplicate-listener outage),
 true only when postinst found nothing conflicting.
